title = "tinkerer"
titleShort = "tinkerer"
description = "[PAWN_nameDef] spent most of [PAWN_possessive] time disassembling and reassembling electronic devices in order to figure out how they function. [PAWN_nameDef] became so preoccupied with [PAWN_possessive] tinkering that [PAWN_pronoun] forgot to develop social relationships with other humans."
